---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
         edges |  -2.692927    .552001    -4.88   0.000    -3.774829   -1.611025
nodecov_wealth |   .0111924   .0047613     2.35   0.019     .0018604    .0205244
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Maximum pseudolikelihood estimate (not full ERGM maximum likelihood unless the model is dyad-independent).

             Null Deviance:     162.2  on 117 degrees of freedom
