-------------+---------------------------------------------------------------
          m1 |      4,970  -3444.941  -1702.469       3   3410.938   3430.472
          m2 |      4,970  -3444.941  -1670.967       4   3349.933   3375.978
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note: BIC uses N = number of observations. See [R] IC note.

. lrtest m2 m1

Likelihood-ratio test
Assumption: m1 nested within m2

 LR chi2(1) =  63.00
Prob > chi2 = 0.0000

